* Thu Nov 19 2026 moWerk <mo@mowerk.net> - 0.5.0
- New: moderation. What owners, admins and moderators may do comes from
  the room's power levels; controls show only where allowed. A person's
  page: role, mute, remove, ban and lift a ban with reasons, revoke an
  invitation, remove their recent messages, report them. Members list
  with requests to join, invited and banned. Room info: history
  visibility, guest access, the room directory, turning on encryption,
  reporting the room. Pages for roles and permissions, addresses,
  server access (refusing a list that shuts out your own server) and
  upgrading the room. Removing others' messages with a reason, pinning,
  a "Pinned (n)" pill. Spaces: suggested rooms, their order, a ban
  across a space's rooms.
- New: reading message by message. The read receipt follows the newest
  message whose end was on screen, never back; a room opens at its
  unread line, loading older pages to find it; the line stays put during
  a visit and moves on leaving; jumps past unread messages leave them
  unread. Fixes rooms with many unread messages being marked read at
  once (Amazfish, 30).
- New: a picture or video sent on its own has no bubble, only rounded
  corners; portrait pictures are as wide as they are.
- New: spoilers are covered by bars, one per line, and shown on a tap;
  "||text||" sends one.
- New: Lock to portrait (Settings > App, off by default); it gives way
  while a slide-out keyboard is open.
- Privacy: all metadata is removed from photos, not only the place
  (orientation and colour profile kept, not re-encoded).
- On phones without Sailfish Secrets, a page after login says the store
  is not encrypted and how to install Secrets; the security ring gives
  the same fix.
- Joining by part of a name (your server's and matrix.org's directory);
  join errors in words; About invites to the forum thread.
- Fixed: files on a memory card went out broken (the sandbox had no
  access); unreadable or empty files now fail with a message. Receipts
  are retried quietly on a weak network instead of showing errors.

* Wed Nov 18 2026 moWerk <mo@mowerk.net> - 0.4.9
- New: Settings in four tabs, Account, Privacy, App, About; Account opens
  with how well messages are protected, each gap named with its fix.
- Privacy: the location is removed from photos before sending (on, with a
  switch); not shown as online unless asked; chat names can stay out of
  notifications and the cover; invitations from strangers can stay quiet;
  a word about Element Call before the first call; the debug log can be
  deleted; the recovery key leaves the clipboard after two minutes; a
  thread's read receipt follows "Send read receipts".
- Notifications also while Rustrx is open, except for the room in front
  (dodoradio).
- The security glance as a ring of glass and light, one line per
  safeguard leading to its fix; the Encryption page and the devices list
  with a green check or a red cross per state; buttons among texts get a
  paragraph's room around them.
- Room info: a tap on the address or the room ID copies it.
- Choice boxes take Silica's press, drag and let go, as menus do.
- Account: "Log out now" is a button, no pulley; About thanks everyone
  who reported or suggested, and credits the bundled font.
- Fixed: on the small cover (more than four on the home screen) the
  bottom line sat under the search icon.
- New: avatar corners from square to round, nothing behind a picture with
  transparency.
- Message menu: reactions, four actions and "More…", as Sailfish apps do
  (dodoradio); a space's three Add items are one page.
- New: uploads can be cancelled.
- Videos go out with a preview frame, their size and length, as other
  clients send them.
- Fixed: on a room's info page that scrolls, opening a choice box threw
  the page back to its top (Luna-Terra-CG).
- Fixed: back in a room after a share had opened another room above it,
  the chat was empty; the room below no longer sends read receipts for
  messages it does not show.
- Memory: about a third less (two malloc arenas, a smaller store cache).
- Fixed: the background stand-in restarted every 71 s while the app was
  open (dodoradio's log).

* Tue Nov 17 2026 moWerk <mo@mowerk.net> - 0.4.8
- Fixed: logged out after a push woke Rustrx with an expired token (the
  rotated refresh token was not saved); a session counts as gone only
  after three answers from the server.
- Notifications: Reply, Mark as read (dodoradio) and three emoji on one
  row, also with Rustrx closed; they vibrate (Fuzzillogic, dodoradio):
  Rustrx brings its own lipstick categories; a ringing call notifies
  again (broken since 0.4.4).
- New: @mentions with pills, slash commands, tap a reply's quote to go to
  the original, an "Unread" pill, bare domains as links.
- New: select text across messages, from a message's menu.
- New: a page per person (verify, direct chat, ignore, remove, ban), the
  ignored users list, invite by part of a name, login with a QR code.
- New: Settings > Privacy, mark messages as read only once shown (on by
  default; off, opening the room is enough).
- Fixed: a picture preview the phone cannot read loads the picture.

* Mon Nov 16 2026 moWerk <mo@mowerk.net> - 0.4.7
- New: on servers with an account service (MAS, matrix.org) the login
  happens on its own page in the browser (OAuth 2.0); the password never
  passes through Rustrx (asked for by poetaster).
- Tests: wiring checks and C++ tests on every push, core tests nightly,
  each proven against a planted bug; a second audit (docs/audits).
- Fixed: messages stuck at "sending" after a network drop; Send again
  resends as it was, pictures and files too.
- Fixed: pinch zoom from the corner (dodoradio); video files decoded as
  pictures; waits left on after a failed page, search or export.
- Fixed: a slow logout could remove a newer login; single sign-on can be
  cancelled and ends after 10 minutes; downloads after a logout.
- Fixed: thread "new replies" from the server's read receipts;
  notifications follow the room's count and go when read elsewhere; the
  pusher is checked at login; the stand-in retries before the first
  unlock.
- Safer: other people's text is plain text, no picture comes from the
  network, one check for links leaving the app, a user link asks before
  a chat, shares of Rustrx's own files refused, drafts in the encrypted
  store, the call log masked.
- Inside: start, handover and exit in order (the core stops before the
  store's lock goes); protocol 2, one name per concept.

* Mon Nov 16 2026 moWerk <mo@mowerk.net> - 0.4.6
- A whole-codebase audit and what it found fixed, no new features
  (docs/AUDIT-2026-11-16.md).
- Fixed: logout left the old account's rooms, thread, pushes, emoji
  cache and verification watchers behind; logout during a call leaves
  the call first.
- Fixed: a reaction the server refused blocked its room at "sending";
  thread root reactions sent twice; + and React with text in threads.
- Fixed: list settings lost to the sandbox at every restart; settings
  switches after the first tap; drafts and typing notices; reply after
  an edit in threads; the cover's unread action and direct chats.
- Fixed: shared photos without a known file ending sent as files; the
  message field under the keyboard while a long message grows; quick
  reactions in the message menu; read receipts at most twice a second.
- Fixed: in threads the emoji picker swaps with the keyboard in place.
- New: Settings makes a new recovery key when the old one is lost.
- Faster: each message formatted once instead of three to five times,
  hidden parts built only when shown, room sort keys built once.
- Inside: one composer for rooms and threads, the core's dispatch
  split, named numbers and keys (Tunables.qml, Keys.h, consts.rs).

* Mon Nov 16 2026 moWerk <mo@mowerk.net> - 0.4.5
- New: push notifications through UnifiedPush (Foghorn): nothing of
  Rustrx keeps running while it is closed; one choice in Settings for
  when Rustrx is closed (push, background, none).
- New: favourites with new messages glow in the lists (Appearance).
- New: each tab keeps its own order and filter switches; room settings
  list threads and members (searchable) on pages of their own; the
  emoji button in threads.
- Fixed: idle CPU about 30 times lower (an SDK store lock renewed 20
  times a second; room updates redid work for every room).
- Fixed: the chat keeps its place after a picture, a thread or settings;
